 mensagens anteriores</button><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="transcript-spacer" style="height: 33009.9px;"></div><div data-rs-index="43" data-index="43" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="4" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;" aria-hidden="true"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="48" aria-posinset="44" aria-label="Mensagem 44 de 48"><div data-test-render-count="2"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-testid="assistant-message" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Claude respondeu: A estrutura está certa: img no lugar, evidencias.md atualizado, código e .gitignore adicionados.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div class=""><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">A estrutura está certa: <code dir="ltr">img</code> no lugar, <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code> atualizado, código e <code dir="ltr">.gitignore</code> adicionados.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Antes do push faltam três prints e dois trechos de texto. Se subir agora, o documento fica com imagens quebradas e com "[PREENCHER]" à vista.</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Tire os três prints que faltam</strong> e salve em <code dir="ltr">docs/harness/img/</code>:
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><code dir="ltr">03-testes-11-passando.png</code>: rode <code dir="ltr">npm run test</code> no terminal e capture o final da saída (<code dir="ltr">pass 11</code>, <code dir="ltr">fail 0</code>).</li>
<li><code dir="ltr">04-hook-lint-erro-json.png</code>: no chat do Antigravity, abra o "Thought for 3s" logo abaixo do "Thought for 29s" e capture o texto sobre o erro de JSON no hook.</li>
<li><code dir="ltr">05-contexto.png</code>: digite <code dir="ltr">/context</code> no chat e capture o resultado.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Edite dois trechos no <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code>:</strong>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li>Na seção 4, troque a linha <code dir="ltr">[PREENCHER: ...]</code> por uma frase com o que o <code dir="ltr">/context</code> mostrou e, logo abaixo, a linha <code dir="ltr">![Resultado do /context](img/05-contexto.png)</code>.</li>
<li>Na última pergunta, troque a linha <code dir="ltr">[CONFIRMAR COM QUEM RODOU O RELATÓRIO...]</code> pela resposta da sua colega ou, se ninguém souber, por: "O segundo relatório ainda não foi gerado; só existe o <code dir="ltr">relatorio-1.md</code>."</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Envie:</strong></li>
</ol>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="Código" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copiar para a área de transferência" id="_r_2cn_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;">   git add .
   git commit -m "docs: adiciona evidências do harness e corrige hook de lint"
   git push origin harness</code></pre></div></div></div>
<ol dir="ltr" start="4">
<li><strong>Confira no GitHub:</strong> abra o repositório, troque para a branch <code dir="ltr">harness</code> e entre em <code dir="ltr">docs/harness/evidencias.md</code> para ver se as imagens aparecem. Depois avise no grupo.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">Se o <code dir="ltr">/context</code> não existir nessa versão ou você não achar o Thought do erro de JSON, me avise que eu ajusto o documento para não depender desses prints.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" role="toolbar" aria-label="Ações da mensagem" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary ml-[calc(var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)_-_0.375rem)] -mt-1" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="action-bar-copy" id="_r_2ce_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><sp