<p dir="ltr">Agora falta só o teste de contexto e os dois trechos de texto:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Rode <code dir="ltr">/context</code></strong> no chat do Antigravity e me mande o print. Eu renomeio para <code dir="ltr">05-contexto.png</code> e te passo a frase pronta para a seção 4.</li>
<li><strong>Última pergunta do <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code>:</strong> troque a linha <code dir="ltr">[CONFIRMAR COM QUEM RODOU O RELATÓRIO...]</code> pela resposta da sua colega ou, se ninguém souber, por: "O segundo relatório ainda não foi gerado; só existe o <code dir="ltr">relatorio-1.md</code>."</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">Depois disso é o commit e o push.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pb-2 pt-4 pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)]"><div data-transcript-stays-put=""><div data-sheet-kind="image" class="group/artifact-block relative isolate flex w-full max-w-[520px] items-center gap-5 overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,calc(var(--cds-radius)+4px))] pb-2 pl-5 pr-4 pt-1.5 text-left font-sans transition-[background-color,border-color,box-shadow,--tw-gradient-from,--tw-gradient-to] duration-base ease-out border-0.5 border-strong bg-linear-to-b shadow-field-drop from-violet-10/10 to-violet-10/10 dark:from-violet-800/15 dark:to-violet-800/15 bg-gray-0/30 dark:bg-gray-830/30 has-[&gt;button:focus-visible]:shadow-focus hover:border-alpha-4 hover:from-violet-10/40 hover:to-violet-10/40 dark:hover:from-violet-800/33 dark:hover:to-violet-800/33"><button type="button" data-testid="file-card-open" aria-pressed="false" class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer rounded-[inherit] focus-visible:outline-none" aria-label="Ver 03 testes 11 passando"></button><div class="pointer-events-none relative h-14 w-14 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sheet-card-under absolute inset-x-0 top-2.5 h-[72px] shadow-field-drop rounded border-0.5 inset-shadow-[0.5px_1px_0] inset-shadow-white/95 inset-ring inset-ring-white/40 [--sheet-card-lit:0.55] dark:inset-shadow-white/15 dark:inset-ring-white/5 dark:[--sheet-card-lit:0.08] bg-violet-50 border-violet-200 dark:bg-violet-800 dark:border-violet-700"></div><div class="sheet-card-page absolute inset-x-0 top-2.5 flex h-[72px] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pb-[18px] shadow-lg dark:[--sheet-card-ink-boost:5%] rounded border-0.5 inset-shadow-[0.5px_1px_0] inset-shadow-white/95 inset-ring inset-ring-white/40 [--sheet-card-lit:0.55] dark:inset-shadow-white/15 dark:inset-ring-white/5 dark:[--sheet-card-lit:0.08] bg-violet-50 border-violet-200 dark:bg-violet-800 dark:border-violet-700 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-300 gro