[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 aria-disabled:opacity-disabled aria-disabled:pointer-events-none" aria-label="Tentar novamente" data-testid="action-bar-retry" id="_r_2id_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 533.3;"></span></span></button><time data-cds-reveal-on-hover="" data-cds="RelativeTime" datetime="2026-10-03T22:27:53.686Z" class="flex h-control items-center ps-sm pe-sm first:ps-0 last:pe-0 text-caption font-normal text-muted select-none" id="_r_2ig_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="">há 22 minutos</time></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="46" data-index="46" data-testid="transcript-row" data-perf-row="human" data-perf-row-from-tail="1" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;" aria-hidden="true"><div role="article" tabindex="0" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="48" aria-posinset="47" aria-label="Mensagem 47 de 48"><div data-test-render-count="2"><div class="contents"><div class="mb-1 mt-[var(--msg-gap,1.5rem)] group group/message-row"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Você enviou: Arquivos de Governança e Regras de Projeto (&lt;RULE&gt;)</h2><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1"><div data-cds="UserMessage" class="group/message-row ms-auto flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-xs font-sans cds-um-enter"><div data-cds="MessageAttachments" data-fit="natural" class="flex w-full flex-wrap gap-xs justify-end items-end" data-find-omitted="" data-natural-tiles=""><div tabindex="-1" data-cds="MessageAttachmentsImage" data-fit="natural" data-testid="file-thumbnail" class="group/tile relative isolate flex h-fit w-fit shrink-0 rounded-card outline-none focus-visible:shadow-focus"><div data-cds="Card" data-size="xs" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[''] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus max-w-full [--cds-ring-color:var(--cds-border-strong)] [--cds-ring-inner:var(--cds-ring-hairline)] [--cds-ring-outer:0px]" style="--cds-card-press-sx: 0.9683364254792827; --cds-card-press-sy: 0.987498779177654; --cds-card-press-d: 2px;"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit] shadow-field-drop"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" data-cds-tile-media="" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t flex"><span data-cds="CardLink" role="button" tabindex="0" class="cds-reset outline-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-card after:content-[''] after:pointer-events-none flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center justify-center self-stretch cursor-zoom-in"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="block transition-opacity duration-base motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-100" src="blob:https://claude.ai/ec26426b-1ead-4dcb-a23a-132004adab25" data-cds-tile-picture="" data-loaded="" style="visibility: hidden;"><span class="sr-only">1791066549242_image.png</span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs rounded-[var(--cds-message-bubble-radius)] px-[var(--cds-message-bubble-pad-x)] py-[var(--cds-message-bubble-pad-y)] text-heading font-normal break-words select-text text-primary max-w-[var(--cds-message-bubble-measure)] bg-[var(--cds-bg-user-message)]"><div id="_r_2ir_" class="overflow-hidden [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,black_calc(100%_-_3rem),transparent)] [&amp;_:is(a[href],area[href],button,input,select,textarea,summary,iframe,embed,audio,video,[role=button],[role=link],[data-cds-collapsed-control])]:pointer-events-none" style="max-height: 200px;"><div class="cds-user-message-body"><div data-testid="user-message" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 relative [&amp;_ul]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ol]:!space-y-0 [&amp;_ul]:ps-8 [&amp;_ol]:ps-8 [--msg-block-radius:initial]"><ol class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">Arquivos de Governança e Regras de Projeto (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;RULE&gt;</code>)<br>Carregados automaticamente no contexto raiz antes de qualquer requisição:</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">AGENTS.md</code>:
 <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Stack e Execução: Node.js (v24.x) / JavaScript (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm install</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run dev</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run test</code>).</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Estrutura de Diretórios: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">docs/specs/</code> (fonte da verdade), <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/</code> (código-fonte), <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">tests/</code> (testes automatizados).</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Regras de Governança: Toda funcionalidade deriva de especificações em <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">docs/specs/</code>; critérios de aceite obrigatórios (Dado/Quando/Então) antes da escrita de código.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Princípios Operacionais (Karpathy):
 1. Pense antes de programar: declaração de suposições e alinhamento prévio.
 2. Simplicidade primeiro: mínimo código necessário, sem abstrações especulativas.
 3. Mudanças cirúrgicas: alteração apenas nos arquivos pertinentes.
 4. Execução guiada por objetivo: conversão direta de critérios de aceite em testes antes da entrega.</li></ul></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">CLAUDE.md</code>:<br> <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Configurações do harness Antigravity.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Obrigatoriedade do respeito aos hooks em <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.agents/hooks.json</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Bloqueio estrito de acesso ao <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.env</code> e segredos via <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">PreToolUse</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Ativação obrigatória da skill <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">verificar-parcelas</code> para cálculos financeiros.</li></ul></p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">Skills Habilitadas no Workspace</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">verificar-parcelas</code>:<br> <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Gatilho: Implementação, teste ou debug de lógicas de cálculo de parcelas da venda.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Passo a passo injetado:
 1. Leitura da especificação em <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">docs/specs/</code>.
 2. Divisão do valor e truncamento em centavos.
 3. Atribuição da sobra de centavos exclusivamente na 1ª parcela (RN-01).
 4. Ajuste para o último dia válido em calendários mensais (RN-02).
 5. Adição de 15 dias corridos por parcela em intervalos quinzenais (RN-03).
 6. Passo de prova obrigatório via <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run test</code> validando TC-01 e TC-02.</li></ul></p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">Hooks de Segurança e Qualidade (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.agents/hooks.json</code>)</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">permissions-gate</code> (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">PreToolUse</code>):
 <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Ferramentas monitoradas: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">run_command</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">view_file</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">replace_file_content</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">write_to_file</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">multi_replace_file_content</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Script: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">scripts/permissions.js</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Regras ativas:
 <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">deny</code>: qualquer tentativa de leitura ou escrita em arquivos contendo <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.env</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">deny</code>: comandos destrutivos (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">rm -rf</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Remove-Item</code>).</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ask</code>: instalação de pacotes (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm install</code>).</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">allow</code>: execução de testes e lint (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run test</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">npm run lint</code>).</li></ul></li></ul></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">auto-lint</code> (<code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">PostToolUse</code>):<br> <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Disparado após <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">write_to_file</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">replace_file_content</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">multi_replace_file_content</code> para validação imediata em malha fechada.</li></ul></p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">Especificações Ativas (Fonte da Verdade)</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr"><code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">docs/specs/001-venda-parcelada-e-cobranca.md.txt</code>:<br> <ul class="[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 ps-7" dir="ltr"><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Regras de Negócio: RN-01 a RN-07.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Casos de Teste Padronizados: TC-01 a TC-07.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Critérios de Aceite: Cenários 1, 2, 3 e 4.</li></ul></p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words"><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">Ferramentas Disponíveis na Sessão</p></li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Arquivos: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">view_file</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">write_to_file</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">replace_file_content</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Comandos &amp; Processos: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">run_command</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">manage_task</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">schedule</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Subagentes &amp; Comunicação: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">invoke_subagent</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">define_subagent</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">manage_subagents</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">send_message</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ask_question</code>.</li><li class="whitespace-normal break-words">Pesquisa &amp; Web: <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">search_web</code>, <code dir="ltr" class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">read_url_content</code>.</li></ol><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words" dir="ltr">7:28 PM</p></div></div></div><span data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Mensagem recolhida</span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus px-md self-start -ms-pad-md" data-find-omitted="" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_2ir_"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shado