pan></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region"></span><div class="max-w-[85%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="47" data-index="47" data-testid="transcript-row" data-last-message="true" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="0" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative;"><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="48" aria-posinset="48" aria-label="Mensagem 48 de 48"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group group/message-row"><div class="contents"><div data-testid="assistant-message" class="group relative relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]" style="" data-is-streaming="false"><h2 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none" aria-hidden="true">Claude respondeu: O quarto teste passou: o /context mostra o AGENTS.md e o CLAUDE.md carregados antes de qualquer pedido, além da skill e dos hooks.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;_.md-table-scroll]:pr-[var(--msg-inset-end,0.5rem)]"><div><div class="grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 min-w-0"><div data-find-omitted="" class="contents"><div class="min-w-0 [--msg-block-radius:initial] ps-[var(--msg-text-inset,0.5rem)] [&amp;&gt;[data-cds=TurnStatus]&gt;[data-cds-row-panel]]