"inline-flex h-[1lh] items-center justify-center text-muted transition-transform duration-fast motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover/status:text-secondary group-has-[:focus-visible]/status:text-secondary"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(0.75rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 577.8;"></span></span></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Executou um comando, arquivos compartilhados</span></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] isolate min-w-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div style=""><div class=""><div data-cds="Prose" class="prose" style="--_prose-font-body: var(--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_4za3l_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block standard-markdown"><p dir="ltr">O quarto teste passou: o <code dir="ltr">/context</code> mostra o <code dir="ltr">AGENTS.md</code> e o <code dir="ltr">CLAUDE.md</code> carregados antes de qualquer pedido, além da skill e dos hooks. O <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code> está completo, sem nenhum trecho entre colchetes.</p>
<p dir="ltr">O <code dir="ltr">entrega-harness.zip</code> traz o <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code> final e a pasta <code dir="ltr">img</code> com os oito prints. Para terminar:</p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Extraia o zip dentro de <code dir="ltr">docs/harness/</code></strong>, substituindo o <code dir="ltr">evidencias.md</code> e a pasta <code dir="ltr">img</code> que já estão lá.</li>
<li><strong>Envie:</strong></li>
</ol>
